  "scope": "Two prompts queued in a retained Agent chat after normal restart and Goal clear. Actual browser, server, full worker and native Codex use private PostgreSQL and Redis with a controlled model endpoint. SIGKILL the worker-owner peer while the browser peer stays live.",
